
== global keymaps (leader is space)
n  pM          prigh: model
n  pa          prigh: attach buffer
n  pc          prigh: cancel turn
n  pd          prigh: attach diagnostics
n  pl          prigh: log
n  pm          prigh: mode
n  pn          prigh: new session
n  po          prigh: config options
n  pp          prigh: toggle chat
n  pr          prigh: review changes
n  ps          prigh: sessions
n  px          prigh: clear attachments
x  pa          prigh: attach selection
x  pd          prigh: attach diagnostics of the selection

== commands
Prigh          prigh: toggle the chat
PrighAdd       prigh: attach the buffer, the range or diagnostics
PrighCancel    prigh: cancel the running turn
PrighConfig    prigh: pick a config option
PrighLog       prigh: show the agent's log
PrighMode      prigh: pick the session mode
PrighModel     prigh: pick the model
PrighNew       prigh: start a new session
PrighRestart   prigh: restart the agent
PrighReview    prigh: review the agent's changes hunk by hunk
PrighSessions  prigh: pick a session to load

== keymaps = false
prigh keymaps: 0

== chat help (g?)
Chat window
  n   q        close the chat
  n   <Tab>    expand/collapse the card under the cursor
  n   <CR>     open the location under the cursor
  n   i        write a prompt
  n   a        write a prompt
  n   o        write a prompt
  n   <C-c>    cancel the turn (queued prompts return to the input)
  n   g?       show these keys
Prompt
  n   <CR>     send the prompt (queued while a turn runs)
  ni  <C-s>    send the prompt
  ni  <C-c>    cancel the turn
  n   q        close the chat
  n   g?       show these keys
  i   @        insert @ and complete a project file
  i   /        at the start: complete a slash command
Permission cards
  a/A/r/R (or 1-9) choose · <CR> option under cursor · d full diff · <Esc> cancel
Press q or <Esc> to close
help closed: true

== buffer-local keys
chat  n <Tab>   prigh: expand/collapse the card under the cursor
chat  n <CR>    prigh: open the location under the cursor
chat  n a       prigh: write a prompt
chat  n g?      prigh: show these keys
chat  n i       prigh: write a prompt
chat  n o       prigh: write a prompt
chat  n q       prigh: close the chat
chat  n <C-C>   prigh: cancel the turn (queued prompts return to the input)
input n <CR>    prigh: send the prompt (queued while a turn runs)
input n g?      prigh: show these keys
input n q       prigh: close the chat
input n <C-C>   prigh: cancel the turn
input n <C-S>   prigh: send the prompt
input i <C-C>   prigh: cancel the turn
input i <C-S>   prigh: send the prompt
input i /       prigh: at the start: complete a slash command
input i @       prigh: insert @ and complete a project file

== :checkhealth prigh
start prigh.nvim
ok    Neovim <version>
error prigh-does-not-exist not found on PATH
      advice: install prigh (see its README) or set require('prigh').setup{ cmd = { '/path/to/prigh', 'acp' } }
ok    markdown treesitter parser: the chat is highlighted
ok    git: @ completion lists the project's files
info  state: stopped
